{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6acb3c01abf5d495aecf9a11ad3bc10d9df821f04555dba775d9e9ad407bf929", "ja": "そうだな。現代美術の一種とは聞いてたけど……\n空間ごと巨大なアートにするのは、すごいなぁ。", "zh": "没错。虽然听说这是一种现代艺术……但把整个空间都变成巨大的艺术作品，真是厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "beff3ed98fd79c757fe5617f57072fe9e0c10287bc4593211225c81fc169d397", "ja": "イグザクトリーです！　{$P$}が\n感じた気持ちこそが、このアートのポイントなんです！", "zh": "没错！{$P$}先生感受到的心情，正是这件艺术品的关键！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2f63a43f6b3b2376a95e232f0787f0a3247b96ef4be4adb5128c23d0a463fb32", "ja": "なるほど……。ロコの説明で、見どころがわかるから\n面白いな。よければ、もっと教えてもらってもいいか？", "zh": "原来如此……。通过ROCO的说明，就能了解其中的看点，真有意思。可以的话，能再多给我讲讲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "a3e72476cded5ff26869405a32ed482f9070ba59c53dddb7c206e7ecc208e74b", "ja": "わかりました！　ロコがたくさんガイドしますね♪\n次は、あっちに行きましょう！", "zh": "明白！　ROCO来好好为您导览♪\n接下来，去那边看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2f2f9a4f74d32306ad0120ecd6ebeb0e3571fed5aeb097e61bc1281196214cf4", "ja": "（ロコと一緒に、いろいろなアートを見ていると、\nあっという間に時間が過ぎていった……）", "zh": "（和ROCO一起欣赏着各种各样的艺术作品，\n时间转眼间就过去了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0f7c6b9c9c5ebec8af7da766226ddc2c279909be2d347e63fc8e47d6990c6b9a", "ja": "いや～。どのアートも圧巻だったな……。\n今日一日で、五感が刺激されたよ。", "zh": "哎呀～。不管哪件艺术作品都很震撼啊……\n今天这一整天，五感都被彻底激发了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "20ac4f8c1dc31bc662269bf726c59b6fffc213d99252fcb66a2fa39096e08492", "ja": "はい！　インスタレーションは、\n全身でエクスペリエンスするものですからね！", "zh": "没错！装置艺术就是要用全身去体验的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "c52b6e7985be73e0115837a7485c8a2668b9e245e496ab88e57c4831ad0f8517", "ja": "{$P$}にも、シンパシーを感じて\nもらえて……ロコは感激です～！", "zh": "能让{$P$}也产生同感……ROCO太感激了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3e4570b121be821fbca2d7893c01fd29f13cf3c8a43e40e454f9f34e326b631d", "ja": "ははっ。今日はここに来られてよかったよ。\n……と、もうこんな時間か。", "zh": "哈哈，今天能来到这里真是太好了。\n……啊，已经这么晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "9bd37b07731e7dd346aac7399c67f0038d6126f09256db156c0a2e1848a89aed", "ja": "あっ、そうですね。{$P$}、\n今日は付き合ってくれて、サンクスでした！", "zh": "啊，对哦。{$P$}，今天谢谢你陪我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "a4ec99711282bcd8efea601c6af50e56922d06015de6c182de5266698d280b58", "ja": "うう。どうして一日はこんなにショートなんでしょう。\nアートの魅力は、まだまだあるのに……。", "zh": "呜呜。一天为什么这么短呢。\n艺术的魅力明明还有好多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1014_p", "source_sha256": "144cbbba09a9a3be6da69ad831feace1fcdcc5d1bf1890f93c70bc21f1448bf5", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。ロコ、また今度来ようか？\nその時は、みんなも誘って……。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。ROCO，下次还要再来吗？到时候也邀请大家一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "bbcdb69ba48f568aef0af3a1fb90fbd2b03d90551ed26595ed082411c2d27e87", "ja": "そう、ですね。また、次がありますよね……。\nで、でもロコは……。", "zh": "是、是这样呢。还会有下次的，对吧……  \n可、可是ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1016_p", "source_sha256": "22f123b1b8d95449b983660d28e163209dab57ca6262aca8aa3204e0906d708d", "ja": "ロコ……？", "zh": "ROCO……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "35fe13cf6a33d03fc3787931eced5710a5ed1cd0be2f482fc78fcd0fa0dd6ab7", "ja": "あっ……な、なんでもありません。\nえへへ……。", "zh": "啊……没、没什么。\n嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1018_p", "source_sha256": "64c4d6659c7a1a6952b61724bbed802a86ceffb3443f5022eeebaccab08db4ee", "ja": "……なあ、ロコ。もし時間が大丈夫なら、\nこれからご飯でも食べに行かないか？", "zh": "……我说，ROCO。要是时间方便的话，\n等下要不要一起去吃个饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "2c0db85265d1b9da71ce7aa35b58218c29dd996e28a27d50a11431186f5d02c8", "ja": "えっ……い、いいんですか？\n{$P$}も疲れてるんじゃ……。", "zh": "咦……可、可以吗？\n{$P$}先生不是也累了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
