{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "d102f74a93ce3dec3ed3ca42093897048b858a883aa12c25cba5a8e232d94fbd", "ja": "ノープロブレムです！　ロコズファミリーには、\n帰りが遅くなるって、メールしてますから！", "zh": "没问题！我已经给ROCO的家人发邮件，说我会晚点回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1f0fd0fe377d44c32967476a65a491de9b5653190c0cdc7534c3bf52d635d727", "ja": "えっ？　いつのまに……。", "zh": "咦？什么时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0394_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "508acd0fbe84c24908daeb49f584c86a81c20b79783462aaa9dab58118641013", "ja": "それじゃあ、{$P$}。アートについて\nい～っぱいトークしましょうね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}。关于艺术，\n我们来好好聊个够吧！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
